msgstr "人類"

#. identityKinds.youkai
#: src/data/mytu.js:5
msgctxt "text:identityKinds.youkai"
msgid "Youkai"
msgstr "妖怪"

#. identityKinds.fairy
#: src/data/mytu.js:6
msgctxt "text:identityKinds.fairy"
msgid "Fairy"
msgstr "妖精"

#. identityKinds.magician
#: src/data/mytu.js:7
msgctxt "text:identityKinds.magician"
msgid "Magician"
msgstr "魔法使"

#. identityKinds.spirit
#: src/data/mytu.js:8
msgctxt "text:identityKinds.spirit"
msgid "Ghost / spirit"
msgstr "幽靈／靈體"

#. identityKinds.lunar
#: src/data/mytu.js:9
msgctxt "text:identityKinds.lunar"
msgid "Lunarian / moon rabbit"
msgstr "月之民／月兔"

#. identityKinds.other
#: src/data/mytu.js:10
msgctxt "text:identityKinds.other"
msgid "Other / undecided"
msgstr "其他／尚未決定"

#. originKinds.gensokyo
#: src/data/mytu.js:14
msgctxt "text:originKinds.gensokyo"
msgid "Gensokyo resident"
msgstr "幻想鄉居民"

#. originKinds.outside
#: src/data/mytu.js:15
msgctxt "text:originKinds.outside"
msgid "Outside World visitor"
msgstr "外界來訪者"

#. originKinds.lunar
#: src/data/mytu.js:16
msgctxt "text:originKinds.lunar"
msgid "Moon / Lunar Capital"
msgstr "月面與月都"

#. originKinds.shifting
#: src/data/mytu.js:17
msgctxt "text:originKinds.shifting"
msgid "Residence moves"
msgstr "居所會移動"

#. reviewers.reimu.name
#: src/data/mytu.js:32
msgctxt "text:reviewers.reimu.name"
msgid "Reimu Hakurei"
msgstr "博麗 靈夢"

#. reviewers.reimu.role
#: src/data/mytu.js:33
msgctxt "text:reviewers.reimu.role"
msgid "Professor of Incident Response"
msgstr "異變應對實務教授"

#. reviewers.reimu.note
#: src/data/mytu.js:35
msgctxt "text:reviewers.reimu.note"
msgid ""
"Proceed. Keep the exit and no-Bomb conditions. If the shrine barrier breaks, "
"your lab pays for it."
msgstr "可以進行，退路和禁用Bomb的條件要守好。神社結界弄壞了，研究室出錢。"

#. reviewers.yukari.name
#: src/data/mytu.js:38
msgctxt "text:reviewers.yukari.name"
msgid "Yukari Yakumo"
msgstr "八雲 紫"

#. reviewers.yukari.role
#: src/data/mytu.js:39
msgctxt "text:reviewers.yukari.role"
msgid "Founding Professor of Boundary Studies"
msgstr "結界研究創院教授"

#. reviewers.yukari.note
#: src/data/mytu.js:41
msgctxt "text:reviewers.yukari.note"
msgid ""
"The question has reached a boundary worth studying. Approved for interview; "
"whether the interview is inside or outside campus will be defined that day."
msgstr "問題已經碰到一條值得研究的邊界。批准進入面試；至於面試在校內還是校外，屆時再定義。"

#. reviewers.keine.name
#: src/data/mytu.js:44
msgctxt "text:reviewers.keine.name"
msgid "Keine Kamishirasawa"
msgstr "上白澤 慧音"

#. reviewers.keine.role
#: src/data/mytu.js:45
msgctxt "text:reviewers.keine.role"
msgid "Dean of History and Records"
msgstr "歷史記錄學院院長"

#. reviewers.keine.note
#: src/data/mytu.js:47
msgctxt "text:reviewers.keine.note"
msgid ""
"Separate what happened, who recorded it, and which version was allowed to "
"remain. The current method still treats later narration as contemporary "
"evidence."
msgstr "請把「發生了什麼」「誰留下記錄」與「哪一版被允許保存」分成三欄。現在的方法仍會把後來的敘述當成當時的證據。"

#. reviewers.patchouli.name
#: src/data/mytu.js:50
msgctxt "text:reviewers.patchouli.name"
msgid "Patchouli Knowledge"
msgstr "帕秋莉・諾蕾姬"

#. reviewers.patchouli.role
#: src/data/mytu.js:51
msgctxt "text:reviewers.patchouli.role"
msgid "Professor of Elemental Theory"
msgstr "元素理論教授"

#. reviewers.patchouli.note
#: src/data/mytu.js:53
msgctxt "text:reviewers.patchouli.note"
msgid ""
"Define readability, latency, route solving, and resource limits separately. "
"Then state what result would disprove the claim."
msgstr "辨識度、延遲、路徑求解與資源限制分開定義，再寫明什麼結果會推翻主張。"

#. reviewers.marisa.name
#: src/data/mytu.js:56
msgctxt "text:reviewers.marisa.name"
msgid "Marisa Kirisame"
msgstr "霧雨 魔理沙"

#. reviewers.marisa.role
#: src/data/mytu.js:57
msgctxt "text:reviewers.marisa.role"
msgid "Professor of Applied Magic"
msgstr "應用魔法教授"

#. reviewers.marisa.note
#: src/data/mytu.js:59
msgctxt "text:reviewers.marisa.note"
msgid ""
"Let's run it. Bring three repeatable failures and a materials list before "
"the formal trial. I'll help with the failures."
msgstr "跑跑看吧。正式試驗前，帶三次能重現的失敗和材料清單來。失敗那部分我可以幫忙。"

#. reviewers.eirin.name
#: src/data/mytu.js:62
msgctxt "text:reviewers.eirin.name"
msgid "Eirin Yagokoro"
msgstr "八意 永琳"

#. reviewers.eirin.role
#: src/data/mytu.js:63
msgctxt "text:reviewers.eirin.role"
msgid "Dean of Lunar Medicine"
msgstr "月都醫藥生命學院院長"

#. reviewers.eirin.note
#: src/data/mytu.js:65
msgctxt "text:reviewers.eirin.note"
msgid ""
"The question may proceed. Record lunar response separately from fatigue. "
"Housing is provisionally near the bamboo clinic route; do not follow the "
"fourth lantern."
msgstr "研究問題可以進入下一階段。月相反應與疲勞必須各自記錄；住宿暫排竹林診療線附近，不得跟隨第四盞燈。"

#. reviewers.nitori.name
#: src/data/mytu.js:68
msgctxt "text:reviewers.nitori.name"
msgid "Nitori Kawashiro"
msgstr "河城 荷取"

#. reviewers.nitori.role
#: src/data/mytu.js:69
msgctxt "text:reviewers.nitori.role"
msgid "Dean of Kappa Engineering"
msgstr "河童工程學院院長"

#. reviewers.nitori.note
#: src/data/mytu.js:71
msgctxt "text:reviewers.nitori.note"
msgid ""
"Prototype approved. Log inputs, outputs, failure times, and the tape batch. "
"Leave room for a wrench."
msgstr "原型通過。記下輸入、輸出、故障時間和膠帶批次，也留點伸扳手的空間。"

#. reviewers.aya.name
#: src/data/mytu.js:74
msgctxt "text:reviewers.aya.name"
msgid "Aya Shameimaru"
msgstr "射命丸 文"

#. reviewers.aya.role
#: src/data/mytu.js:75
msgctxt "text:reviewers.aya.role"
msgid "Dean of Tengu Journalism"
msgstr "天狗新聞傳播學院院長"

#. reviewers.aya.note
#: src/data/mytu.js:77
msgctxt "text:reviewers.aya.note"
msgid ""
"I'd put this on page one. Add your sources and correction plan before I "
"choose the headline."
msgstr "這個我想放頭版。先補上來源和更正方法，我再挑標題。"

#. reviewers.byakuren.name
#: src/data/mytu.js:80
msgctxt "text:reviewers.byakuren.name"
msgid "Byakuren Hijiri"
msgstr "聖 白蓮"

#. reviewers.byakuren.role
#: src/data/mytu.js:81
msgctxt "text:reviewers.byakuren.role"
msgid "Rotating Professor of Coexistence Practice"
msgstr "共生實務輪值教授"

#. reviewers.byakuren.note
#: src/data/mytu.js:83
msgctxt "text:reviewers.byakuren.note"
msgid ""
"The question recognizes costs borne by different bodies and lifespans. "
"Proceed, but include those who leave no written record in the next method."
msgstr "問題願意看見不同身體與壽命承擔的成本，可以繼續。下一版請把不會留下文字的人也列入方法。"

#. reviewers.kanako.name
#: src/data/mytu.js:86
msgctxt "text:reviewers.kanako.name"
msgid "Kanako Yasaka"
msgstr "八坂 神奈子"

#. reviewers.kanako.role
#: src/data/mytu.js:87
msgctxt "text:reviewers.kanako.role"
msgid "Rotating Professor of Faith Infrastructure"
msgstr "信仰基礎設施輪值教授"

#. reviewers.kanako.note
#: src/data/mytu.js:89
msgctxt "text:reviewers.kanako.note"
msgid ""
"The principle can work. Now tell me who supplies power, who repairs it, and "
"whose festival gets priority."
msgstr "原理行得通。接下來說說誰供電、誰維修，以及哪邊的祭典優先。"

#. reviewers.miko.name
#: src/data/mytu.js:92
msgctxt "text:reviewers.miko.name"
msgid "Toyosatomimi no Miko"
msgstr "豐聰耳 神子"

#. reviewers.miko.role
#: src/data/mytu.js:93
msgctxt "text:reviewers.miko.role"
msgid "Rotating Professor of Public Leadership"
msgstr "公共領導輪值教授"

#. reviewers.miko.note
#: src/data/mytu.js:95
msgctxt "text:reviewers.miko.note"
msgid ""
"I hear eleven desires, but the application answers only three. State which "
"requests you will not satisfy and who bears that decision."
msgstr "我聽見了十一種願望，但申請只回答了其中三種。請公開你不準備滿足哪些要求，以及由誰承擔這個決定。"

#. reviewerCommentary.reimu.question
#: src/data/mytu.js:101
msgctxt "text:reviewerCommentary.reimu.question"
msgid ""
"At what point do I have to deal with this? Mark that on the plan, and tell "
"me who cleans up."
msgstr "從哪一步開始要我出面？在計畫上標出來，還有誰負責收拾。"

#. reviewerCommentary.reimu.method
#: src/data/mytu.js:102
msgctxt "text:reviewerCommentary.reimu.method"
msgid "Write down how to stop it and clean up. I'd like to get back before dinner."
msgstr "把停止和清理的方法寫下來，我還想趕回去吃晚飯。"

#. reviewerCommentary.reimu.needs
#: src/data/mytu.js:103
msgctxt "text:reviewerCommentary.reimu.needs"
msgid "List what you need. The venue, repairs, and my time are three separate expenses."
msgstr "需要什麼就列出來。場地、修理，還有我的時間，是三筆開銷。"

#. reviewerCommentary.yukari.question
#: src/data/mytu.js:106
msgctxt "text:reviewerCommentary.yukari.question"
msgid "You've fixed one side of the question rather firmly. What happens if we move it?"
msgstr "你把問題的一側固定得很牢呢。挪動它之後，會怎樣？"

#. reviewerCommentary.yukari.method
#: src/data/mytu.js:107
msgctxt "text:reviewerCommentary.yukari.method"
msgid ""
"You give the observation point one address. Tell me who is watching when its "
"two sides trade places."
msgstr "觀測點只有一個地址呢。兩側交換位置後，又是誰在觀測？"

#. reviewerCommentary.yukari.needs
#: src/data/mytu.js:108
msgctxt "text:reviewerCommentary.yukari.needs"
msgid ""
"Would you prefer a nearby room, or a room you can reach? We should settle "
"that before assigning one."
msgstr "你要近的房間，還是到得了的房間？分房前先說好吧。"

#. reviewerCommentary.keine.question
#: src/data/mytu.js:111
msgctxt "text:reviewerCommentary.keine.question"
msgid "Who recorded this, and when? Separate what happened from what someone remembered later."
msgstr "誰記錄的？什麼時候？把發生的事與事後回憶分開寫。"

#. reviewerCommentary.keine.method
#: src/data/mytu.js:112
msgctxt "text:reviewerCommentary.keine.method"
msgid ""
"Keep the date and previous text with every correction. Then another student "
"can check your work."
msgstr "每次修正都留下日期與原文，其他學生才查得到。"

#. reviewerCommentary.keine.needs
#: src/data/mytu.js:113
msgctxt "text:reviewerCommentary.keine.needs"
msgid "I'll record what you request now. You can add needs later, with the date of the change."
msgstr "我會記下你目前的需求。之後有新增的，附上變更日期再提出。"

#. reviewerCommentary.patchouli.question
#: src/data/mytu.js:116
msgctxt "text:reviewerCommentary.patchouli.question"
msgid "Two quantities change independently here. Name them before choosing the spell."
msgstr "這裡有兩個能獨立變動的量，選術式前先分別定義。"

#. reviewerCommentary.patchouli.method
#: src/data/mytu.js:117
msgctxt "text:reviewerCommentary.patchouli.method"
msgid ""
"Add a comparison and a failure condition. Which claim will you withdraw if "
"the result reverses?"
msgstr "補上比較對象與失敗條件。結果相反時，你會撤回哪個主張？"

#. reviewerCommentary.patchouli.needs
#: src/data/mytu.js:118
msgctxt "text:reviewerCommentary.patchouli.needs"
msgid ""
"List the material batch, storage conditions, and return date. I'll discuss "
"equipment after that."
msgstr "先列材料批次、保存條件與歸還日期，之後再談設備。"

#. reviewerCommentary.marisa.question
#: src/data/mytu.js:121
msgctxt "text:reviewerCommentary.marisa.question"
msgid ""
"Looks like it might run. Try the cheapest version first; a quick failure "
"saves materials."
msgstr "看起來能跑。先做最便宜的版本吧，早點失敗還能省材料。"

#. reviewerCommentary.marisa.method
#: src/data/mytu.js:122
msgctxt "text:reviewerCommentary.marisa.method"
msgid ""
"Keep enough notes for someone else to get the same result. And list the "
"materials—Patchouli's started checking mine."
msgstr "記到別人照著做也能得到同樣結果。材料也列上，帕秋莉最近連我的欄都要查。"

#. reviewerCommentary.marisa.needs
#: src/data/mytu.js:123
msgctxt "text:reviewerCommentary.marisa.needs"
msgid ""
"List what you want to borrow. I'll check what's here and what I've already "
"borrowed. The workshop gets loud at midnight, by the way."
msgstr "想借什麼就寫上，我看看這裡有多少、我又借走了多少。先說，工房半夜也挺吵的。"

#. reviewerCommentary.eirin.question
#: src/data/mytu.js:126
msgctxt "text:reviewerCommentary.eirin.question"
msgid ""
"Record individual variation, lunar phase, and fatigue separately. They "
"currently share one line."
msgstr "個體差異、月相與疲勞請分開記錄，目前它們擠在同一行。"

#. reviewerCommentary.eirin.method
#: src/data/mytu.js:127
msgctxt "text:reviewerCommentary.eirin.method"
msgid ""
"Define the stopping conditions before dose or exposure. Record “probably "
"fine” as an uncertain response."
msgstr "先訂停止條件，再決定劑量或暴露。「大概沒事」請記為不確定回答。"

#. reviewerCommentary.eirin.needs
#: src/data/mytu.js:128
msgctxt "text:reviewerCommentary.eirin.needs"
msgid ""
"Submit separate requests for treatment, lunar-load reduction, and sleep "
"recovery. Give the slips to Reisen if Tewi combines them."
msgstr "治療、減輕月相負荷與睡眠恢復請分別申請。若帝把回條釘在一起，交給鈴仙。"

#. reviewerCommentary.nitori.question
#: src/data/mytu.js:131
msgctxt "text:reviewerCommentary.nitori.question"
msgid ""
"We can build this. What's the input, what's the output, and how much smoke "
"still counts as working?"
msgstr "這個做得出來。輸入、輸出是什麼？冒多少煙還算正常運轉？"

#. reviewerCommentary.nitori.method
#: src/data/mytu.js:132
msgctxt "text:reviewerCommentary.nitori.method"
msgid ""
"Log the failure time, version, and tape batch. I need to know what happened "
"between those finished-product photos."
msgstr "記下故障時間、版本與膠帶批次。我想知道兩張成品照之間發生了什麼。"

#. reviewerCommentary.nitori.needs
#: src/data/mytu.js:133
msgctxt "text:reviewerCommentary.nitori.needs"
msgid ""
"Include room to open the casing and get a wrench in. If I have to break the "
"box, the repair costs extra."
msgstr "留出開外殼、伸扳手的空間。要是得拆爛盒子才能修，另外收費。"

#. reviewerCommentary.aya.question
#: src/data/mytu.js:136
msgctxt "text:reviewerCommentary.aya.question"
msgid ""
"That would make a fine headline. What evidence would make you change it? "
"Hatate will ask."
msgstr "這個標題不錯。出現什麼證據時，你會改掉它？果也會問的。"

#. reviewerCommentary.aya.method
#: src/data/mytu.js:137
msgctxt "text:reviewerCommentary.aya.method"
msgid ""
"Give the source, witness, and whoever relayed it separate lines. Keep the "
"trail even for an anonymous source. Hatate checks my copies too."
msgstr "消息來源、目擊者與轉述者分欄寫，匿名也要留下傳遞經過。果連我的稿子也會查。"

#. reviewerCommentary.aya.needs
#: src/data/mytu.js:138
msgctxt "text:reviewerCommentary.aya.needs"
msgid "Mark what must stay private. I'd rather discover that before the headline goes to print."
msgstr "先標明哪些內容不能公開，最好在標題送印前讓我知道。"

#. reviewerCommentary.byakuren.question
#: src/data/mytu.js:141
msgctxt "text:reviewerCommentary.byakuren.question"
msgid ""
"Who bears the cost of this comparison? Include different bodies and "
"lifespans, and people who leave no written account."
msgstr "這項比較的代價由誰承擔？請把身體、壽命的差異，以及無法留下文字的人也納入計畫。"

#. reviewerCommentary.byakuren.method
#: src/data/mytu.js:142
msgctxt "text:reviewerCommentary.byakuren.method"
msgid ""
"Provide another way to participate for those who cannot follow the same "
"procedure. Tell us how both routes will be supported."
msgstr "請替無法遵循相同步驟的人另備方法，也說明兩條途徑如何獲得支援。"

#. reviewerCommentary.byakuren.needs
#: src/data/mytu.js:143
msgctxt "text:reviewerCommentary.byakuren.needs"
msgid ""
"Put food, access, and rest in the main plan. The people who need them should "
"be able to take part from the start."
msgstr "把飲食、通行與休息放進主計畫，讓有需要的人從一開始就能參與。"

#. reviewerCommentary.kanako.question
#: src/data/mytu.js:146
msgctxt "text:reviewerCommentary.kanako.question"
msgid "Now connect that principle to water, power, or people. Show me what it supplies."
msgstr "把這個原理接上水、電力或人流，讓我看看它能供應什麼。"

#. reviewerCommentary.kanako.method
#: src/data/mytu.js:147
msgctxt "text:reviewerCommentary.kanako.method"
msgid ""
"Name the maintenance crew, shutdown hours, and festival priority. Someone "
"will have to run this after your presentation."
msgstr "訂好維修人手、停機時段與祭典優先權。你報告完之後，還得有人運轉設備。"

#. reviewerCommentary.kanako.needs
#: src/data/mytu.js:148
msgctxt "text:reviewerCommentary.kanako.needs"
msgid ""
"Separate the capacity you need now from the capacity you'll need when this "
"catches on. We'll discuss the second budget too."
msgstr "把現在需要的容量，和推廣後需要的容量分開。後一筆預算也一起談吧。"

#. reviewerCommentary.miko.question
#: src/data/mytu.js:151
msgctxt "text:reviewerCommentary.miko.question"
msgid ""
"I hear several wishes missing from the proposal. Which will you decline, and "
"who will explain that to the people asking?"
msgstr "我聽見幾個計畫裡沒寫的願望。你會拒絕哪些，又由誰向本人說明？"

#. reviewerCommentary.miko.method
#: src/data/mytu.js:152
msgctxt "text:reviewerCommentary.miko.method"
msgid ""
"Name the person who decides at each turn. I should like to hear from them, "
"rather than “everyone”."
msgstr "把每一步做決定的人寫出來。我想聽本人說，不是聽「大家」說。"

#. reviewerCommentary.miko.needs
#: src/data/mytu.js:153
msgctxt "text:reviewerCommentary.miko.needs"
msgid "Rank your needs now. It is easier than hearing eleven people insist they came first."
msgstr "現在就替需求排個順序，總比同時聽十一個人說「我先」容易吧。"
